* Fang Spear can also be upgraded at the [[Forge of Potential]] with a [[Silver Battle Idol]].

== Notes ==
* Like all spears, the Fang Spear floats if dropped or thrown into water.
* Crafting and upgrading requires less [[Silver]] than other silver-tier weapons.

